msgid ""
"The UTC offset field allows the UTC local time offset to be specified. The "
"local time is displayed below in order to make it easier to verify the "
"correct offset has been entered."
msgstr "Polje za upis odsjeka UTC"

msgid "Use GPS time"
msgstr "Korišć.GPS vremena"

msgid ""
"If enabled sets the clock of the computer to the GPS time once a fix is set. "
"This is only necessary if your computer does not have a real-time clock with "
"battery backup or your computer frequently runs out of battery power or "
"otherwise loses time."
msgstr ""
"Ako je omogućeno, sat computer-a postavlja na vremenski sat GPS-a nakon što "
"se postavi fix. To je potrebno samo ako vaš computer ne ima sat s "
"baterijskom opremom za realno vrijeme ili često izgubi bateriju i drugim "
"razmacima."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Full name"
msgstr "Plavak"

#, no-c-format
msgid "The full name of each waypoint is displayed."
msgstr "Plavak svake putne točke se prikazuje u cijelom obliku."

#, no-c-format
msgid "First word of name"
msgstr "Prva riječ"

#, no-c-format
msgid "The first word of the waypoint name is displayed."
msgstr "Prva riječ svake putne točke se prikazuje."

#, no-c-format
msgid "First 3 letters"
msgstr "Прва 3 слова"

#, no-c-format
msgid "The first 3 letters of the waypoint name are displayed."
msgstr "Прва 3 слова имена путне тачке су приказана."

#, no-c-format
msgid "First 5 letters"
msgstr "Прва 5 слова"

#, no-c-format
msgid "The first 5 letters of the waypoint name are displayed."
msgstr "Прва 5 слова имена путне тачке су приказана."

#, no-c-format
msgid "No waypoint name is displayed."
msgstr "Име путне тачке nije prikazano."

#, no-c-format
msgid "The short name of each waypoint is displayed. If unavailable, the first five letters of the full name are displayed."
msgstr "Кратак назва свake путне тачке је приказан. Ако није доступан, прва пет слова целих назива су приказана."

msgid "Label format"
msgstr "Формат оznake"

msgid "Determines how labels are displayed with each waypoint"
msgstr "Одређује како се оznake приказују уз сваку путну тачку"

#, no-c-format
msgid "No arrival height is displayed."
msgstr "Висина dolaska nije prikazana."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Straight glide"
msgstr "Прavokutni kliz"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Straight glide arrival height (no terrain is considered)."
msgstr "Pravokutni klizovna visina (nije obziran teren)."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Terrain avoidance glide"
msgstr "Kliz za izbjegavanje terena"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Arrival height considering terrain avoidance. Requires \"Reach mode: Turning\" in \"Glide Computer > Route\" settings."
msgstr "Dozvoljena visina za dolazak uzimajući u obzir zračne prepreke. Zadužuje se \"Režim dovršetka: Okretanje\" u postavkama \"Glide Computer > Route\"."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Straight & terrain glide"
msgstr "Pravokutni kliz sa uzimanjem u obzir zračne prepreke"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Both arrival heights are displayed. Requires \"Reach mode: Turning\" in \"Glide Computer > Route\" settings."
msgstr "Oba položaja dolaznog sletanja su prikazani. Zadužuje se \"Režim dovršetka: Okretanje\" u postavkama \"Glide Computer > Route\"."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Required GR & terrain glide"
msgstr "Požrebni odnos klizanja i pravokutni kliz sa uzimanjem u obzir zračne prepreke"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Both Required glide ratio and terrain avoidance height are displayed. Requires \"Reach mode: Turning\" in \"Glide Computer > Route\" settings."
msgstr "Oba požrebna položaja klizanja i dozvoljena visina za dolazak su prikazana. Zadužuje se \"Režim dovršetka: Okretanje\" u postavkama \"Glide Computer > Route\"."

msgid "Determines how arrival height is displayed in waypoint labels"
msgstr "Određuje način prikaza položaja dolaznog sletanja u oznacima putnih točaka"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Rounded rectangle"
msgstr "Okrugli pravokutnik"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Outlined"
msgstr "Okvirni okrugli pravokutnik"

msgid "Label style"
msgstr "Jedrilica"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Task waypoints & airfields"
msgstr "Zadaci putne tacke i letnike"

#, no-c-format
msgid "All waypoints part of a task and all airfields will be displayed."
msgstr "Svi putni tacki i letnici koje su deo zadatka će biti prikazani."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Task waypoints & landables"
msgstr "Zadaci putne tacke i vanaerodromsko sletanje"

#, no-c-format
msgid "All waypoints part of a task and all landables will be displayed."
msgstr "Svi putni tacki i vanaerodromiće koje su deo zadatka će biti prikazani."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Task waypoints"
msgstr "Zadaci putne tacke"

#, no-c-format
msgid "All waypoints part of a task will be displayed."
msgstr "Sve putne tacki koje su deo zadatka će biti prikazane."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Purple circle"
msgstr "Plavih krugova"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Airports and outlanding fields are displayed as purple circles. If the waypoint is reachable a bigger green circle is added behind the purple one. If the waypoint is blocked by a mountain the green circle will be red instead."
msgstr "Letnici i vanaerodromiće se prikazuju kao plavi krugovi. Ako je putna tacka dostupna, postavlja se veći zeleni krug za nju. Ako je putna tacka blokirana planinom, zeleni krug postaje crven."

#, no-c-format
msgid "B/W"
msgstr "Jedrilicarstvo"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Airports and outlanding fields are displayed in white/grey. If the waypoint is reachable the color is changed to green. If the waypoint is blocked by a mountain the color is changed to red instead."
msgstr "Letnici i vanaerodromiće se prikazuju u bijelu/srebrnu boju. Ako je putna tacka dostupna, boja promeni na zelenu. Ako je putna tacka blokirana planinom, boja promeni na crvenu."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Traffic lights"
msgstr "Traffične svetlosti"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Airports and outlanding fields are displayed in the colors of a traffic light. Green if reachable, Orange if blocked by mountain and red if not reachable at all."
msgstr "Letnici i vanaerodromiće se prikazuju u bojama traffične svetlosti. Zelena ako je dostupna, oranževa ako je blokirana planinom i crvena ako nije dostupna."

msgid "Landable symbols"
msgstr "Simboli vanaerodromskog sletanja"

msgid "Three styles are available: Purple circles (WinPilot style), a high contrast (monochrome) style, or orange. The rendering differs for landable field and airport. All styles mark the waypoints within reach green."
msgstr "Tri stilova su dostupni: plavi krugovi (stil WinPilot), visok kontrastni (monokromski) stil ili oranževi. Prikaz različit za vanaerodrom i letnici. Svi stilovi označavaju putne tacke u doslovu zelenom boji."

msgid "Detailed landables"
msgstr "Detaljno vanaerodromsko sletanje"

msgid ""
"[Off] Display fixed icons for landables.\n"
"[On] Show landables with variable information like runway length and heading."
msgstr "[Isključeno] Prikaz fiksnih ikona za vanaerodromsko sletanje."

msgid "Landable size"
msgstr "Veličina vanaerodromskog sletanja"

msgid "A percentage to select the size landables are displayed on the map."
msgstr "Procenat za odabir veličine prikazivanja vanaerodromskog sletanja na karti."

msgid "Scale runway length"
msgstr "Skala dužine letnog traka"

msgid ""
"[Off] Display fixed length for runways.\n"
"[On] Scale displayed runway length based on real length."
msgstr "[Off] Prikaz međusrednje dužine trakaletova."

msgid "Show thermal locations downloaded from Thermal Information Map (thermalmap.info)."
msgstr "Prikaži lokacije termika preuzete sa Thermal Information Map (thermalmap.info)."

msgid "Allow download of declared tasks from Weglide in the Task Manager."
msgstr ""
"Dozvoli preuzimanje deklariranih zadataka iz WeGlide u upravljačkoj "
"komponenti zadaća."

msgid "Automatic Upload"
msgstr "Automatsko otpremanje"

msgid ""
"Asks whether to upload flight to Weglide, after flight is downloaded from "
"external logger."
msgstr ""
"Pitanje o preusmjeravanju leta na WeGlide nakon što je preuzeto iz vanjskog "
"logera."

msgid "Take this from your WeGlide Profile. Or set to 0 if not used."
msgstr "Uzmi od vašeg profilja WeGlide. Postavite na 0 ako nije koristeno."

msgid "Pilot date of birth"
msgstr "Pilot datum rođenja"

msgid "Radius of the OZ cylinder."
msgstr "Poluprečnik cilindra OZ."

msgid "Width of the start/finish gate."
msgstr "Sirina početnog/završnog vratka."

msgid "Radius of the OZ sector."
msgstr "Poluprečnik sektora OZ."

msgid "Start radial"
msgstr "Start p_preč."

msgid "Start radial of the OZ area"
msgstr "Radialni položaj začetka OZ područja."

msgid "Finish radial"
msgstr "Krajni radial"

msgid "Finish radial of the OZ area"
msgstr "Radialni položaj završetka OZ područja."

msgid "Inner radius"
