"\n"

msgid ""
"![](resource:IDB_WARNING_TRIANGLE)\n"
"\n"
"!!! warning\n"
"# Important Safety Notice\n"
"\n"
"By using XCSoar, you acknowledge and accept the following:\n"
"\n"
"## Limitations\n"
"\n"
"- XCSoar is for **situational awareness only**\n"
"- XCSoar is **not** a FLARM display\n"
"- XCSoar is **not** aviation certified in any way\n"
"- The artificial horizon is **not** fit for any purpose\n"
"- Databanks (airspace, waypoints) may contain errors, be incomplete, or **not** up to date\n"
"- NOTAM display does **not** replace proper pre-flight NOTAM briefing\n"
"- NOTAM data may be incomplete, delayed, filtered, or unavailable\n"
"- XCSoar is **not** guaranteed to be error free\n"
"\n"
"## Pilot Responsibility\n"
"\n"
"The **Pilot in Command** is always responsible for the safe operation of the aircraft. Never rely solely on XCSoar for navigation or situational awareness.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"![](resource:IDB_WARNING_TRIANGLE)\n"
"\n"
"!!! warning\n"
"# Važna sigurnosna napomena\n"
"\n"
"Korištenjem XCSoar-a potvrđujete i prihvaćate sljedeće:\n"
"\n"
"## Ograničenja\n"
"\n"
"- XCSoar služi **samo za situacijsku svijest**\n"
"- XCSoar **nije** FLARM zaslon\n"
"- XCSoar **nije** na bilo koji način zrakoplovno certificiran\n"
"- Umjetni horizont **nije** prikladan ni za koju svrhu\n"
"- Baze podataka (zračni prostor, tačke rute) mogu sadržavati pogreške, biti nepotpune ili **zastarjele**\n"
"- Prikaz NOTAM **ne zamjenjuje** pravi predletni briefing NOTAM\n"
"- Podaci NOTAM mogu biti nepotpuni, zakasnjeni, filtrirani ili nedostupni\n"
"- XCSoar **nije** zajamčeno bez grešaka\n"
"\n"
"## Odgovornost pilota\n"
"\n"
"**Zapovjednik** je uvijek odgovoran za siguran rad zrakoplova. Nikada se nemojte oslanjati isključivo na XCSoar za navigaciju ili situacijsku svijest.\n"
"\n"

#, c-format
msgid ""
"# Getting Started\n"
"\n"
"To use XCSoar effectively, configure the following:\n"
"\n"
"- [Restore from backup](xcsoar://dialog/backup) - Restore previous XCSoar data from a USB or SD card (optional)\n"
"\n"
"- [%s] [Map and data](xcsoar://config/site-files) - Download maps, waypoints, and airspace files for your region\n"
"\n"
"- [%s] [Aircraft polar](xcsoar://config/planes) - Set up your aircraft with the correct polar curve\n"
"\n"
"- [%s] [Pilot info](xcsoar://config/logger) - Enter your name and weight\n"
"\n"
"- [%s] [Devices](xcsoar://config/devices) - Connect your flight instruments\n"
"\n"
"- [%s] [WeGlide](xcsoar://config/weglide) - Upload flights automatically to WeGlide\n"
"\n"
"- [%s] [Thermal Information Map](xcsoar://config/weather) - Show thermal locations from thermalmap.info on the map\n"
"\n"
"- [%s] [Safety factors](xcsoar://config/safety) - Set arrival height, terrain clearance and polar degradation\n"
"\n"
"- [%s] [Terrain Display](xcsoar://config/terrain) - Choose terrain colors, shading and contour lines\n"
"\n"
"- [ ] [Live tracking](xcsoar://config/tracking) *(optional)* - Share your position via SkyLines or LiveTrack24\n"
"\n"
"Explore XCSoar easily by restarting in Simulator mode, or by [replaying an IGC flight](xcsoar://dialog/replay)."
msgstr ""
"# Početak rada\n"
"\n"
"Za učinkovito korištenje XCSoar-a konfigurirajte sljedeće:\n"
"\n"
"- [Vrati iz sigurnosne kopije](xcsoar://dialog/backup) - Vrati prethodne XCSoar podatke s USB-a ili SD kartice (opcionalno)\n"
"\n"
"- [%s] [Karta i podaci](xcsoar://config/site-files) - Preuzmite karte, tačke rute i datoteke zračnog prostora za svoju regiju\n"
"\n"
"- [%s] [Polara zrakoplova](xcsoar://config/planes) - Postavite zrakoplov s ispravnom polarom\n"
"\n"
"- [%s] [Podaci pilota](xcsoar://config/logger) - Unesite ime i težinu\n"
"\n"
"- [%s] [Uređaji](xcsoar://config/devices) - Povežite letne instrumente\n"
"\n"
"- [%s] [WeGlide](xcsoar://config/weglide) - Automatski prenosite letove na WeGlide\n"
"\n"
"- [%s] [Karta termičkih informacija](xcsoar://config/weather) - Prikaži lokacije termike s thermalmap.info na karti\n"
"\n"
"- [%s] [Sigurnosni čimbenici](xcsoar://config/safety) - Postavite visinu dolaska, razmak od terena i degradaciju polare\n"
"\n"
"- [%s] [Prikaz terena](xcsoar://config/terrain) - Odaberite boje terena, sjenčanje i konture\n"
"\n"
"- [ ] [Live tracking](xcsoar://config/tracking) *(opcionalno)* - Dijelite položaj putem SkyLines ili LiveTrack24\n"
"\n"
"Istražite XCSoar ponovnim pokretanjem u načinu Simulatora ili [reprodukcijom IGC leta](xcsoar://dialog/replay)."

msgid ""
